	(text "Failure analysis:\nRP2040 Hangs: should be fine if watchdog is enabled\nI2C bus comm issue during operation: can be a problem that's not fixable since the MCU would lose comm with the MP2760s\nMP2750/bat fet fails short: fuse should* blow (rated 4A so???)\nBattery plugged in backwards: not rated, not tested, could blow up the entire charging block, please don't be dum"
